{"abstract":"Der hersker en del misforståelser i debatten om de første anbefalinger fra ekspertudvalget på socialområdet. Vi erkender, at det for nuværende ikke er muligt at introducere et færdigt sæt af anbefalinger, skriver Torben Tranæs og ekspertudvalget på socialområdet.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Tranæs, Torben","Kjellberg, Jakob","Kvist, Jon","Gørtz, Mette","Plougmann Willer, Lise","von Hielmcrone, Anne-Sofie","Stokholm, Trine","Bigum Lundberg, Jakob","Lindhard, Mogens"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-679833"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-VIVE"],"OT":["Esbjerg Kommune"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-GFS"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-VIVE","DI-PR-GFS","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ekspertudvalg svarer igen organisationers kritik beror på misforståelser her er fakta","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/social/artikel/ekspertudvalg-vores-foerste-anbefalinger-indeholder-konkrete-justeringer-af-rammerne-paa-socialomraadet","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-679833","ids":["ruc-68be41bd-6fe7-4563-8570-9139ae8aa3db"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-AC79AE675F8A3DDC573EF667262CEBA7"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"vive the danish center for social science research","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-VIVE","l3nn":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","namevar":["VIVE - The Danish Center for Social Science Research"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-VIVE","used":1},{"